
       IDENTIFICATION DIVISION.

       PROGRAM-ID. CARGAR-CONCEPTOS.

       ENVIRONMENT DIVISION.

       CONFIGURATION SECTION.

      * SOURCE-COMPUTER. IBM WITH DEBUGGING MODE.

       INPUT-OUTPUT SECTION.

       FILE-CONTROL.

       DATA DIVISION.

       FILE SECTION.

       WORKING-STORAGE SECTION.

           EXEC SQL
               INCLUDE SQLCA
           END-EXEC.

           EXEC SQL
               DECLARE CUR-CONCEPTOS CURSOR FOR
                   SELECT CODIGO_CONCEPTO,
                          DESCRIPCION,
                          TIPO_COBRO,
                          ESTADO
                     FROM CONCEPTOS_COBRO
           END-EXEC.

       LINKAGE SECTION.

           01 IN-FECHA-CONTABLE PIC 9(8).

           EXEC SQL
               INCLUDE CPY-CB-CCO
           END-EXEC.

       PROCEDURE DIVISION USING
           IN-FECHA-CONTABLE
           TB-CONCEPTOS-COBRO
           CONCEPTOS-COBRO-COUNT.

       100-MAIN.

           MOVE 0 TO CONCEPTOS-COBRO-COUNT.
           SET IDX-A TO 1.

           EXEC SQL
               OPEN CUR-CONCEPTOS
           END-EXEC.

           PERFORM UNTIL SQLCODE = 100
                      OR CONCEPTOS-COBRO-COUNT >= 50

               EXEC SQL
                   FETCH CUR-CONCEPTOS
                   INTO :CC-CODIGO-CONCEPTO(IDX-A),
                        :CC-DESCRIPCION(IDX-A),
                        :CC-TIPO-COBRO(IDX-A),
                        :CC-ESTADO(IDX-A)
               END-EXEC

               IF SQLCODE = 0
                   ADD 1 TO CONCEPTOS-COBRO-COUNT
                   SET IDX-A UP BY 1
               END-IF

           END-PERFORM.

           EXEC SQL
               CLOSE CUR-CONCEPTOS
           END-EXEC.

           DISPLAY 'FECHA: ' IN-FECHA-CONTABLE.
           DISPLAY 'CONCEPTOS CARGADOS: '
                   CONCEPTOS-COBRO-COUNT.

           GOBACK.
